  "title": "Velvety Chicken Corn Soup",
  "description": "Chicken broth and a can of cream of corn soup are combined with cooked chicken breast in this Chinese inspired soup flavored with sesame oil and thickened with corn starch and egg white.",
  "authors": [
    "Sana S"
  ],
